{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22871","headline":"南浦岁暮对酒送王十五归京 · 白居易","name":"南浦岁暮对酒送王十五归京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊後冰生覆湓水，夜来云闇失庐山。\n风飘细雪落如米，索索萧萧芦苇间。\n此地二年留我住，今朝一酌送君还。\n相看渐老无过醉，聚散穷通总是闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}